    "preamble": "Ailuri Rami Reddy, Krishna District., ... vs The State Of A.P., Pp. on 5 July, 2019 Author: M. Satyanarayana Murthy Bench: M. Satyanarayana Murthy Honourable Sri Justice M. Satyanarayana Murthy Criminal Petition No.13839 of 2014 Order:",
